---
description: Verify Next.js UI/runtime changes with next-dev-loop
globs: apps/*/src/**/*.{ts,tsx,js,jsx,css}
alwaysApply: false
---

When a change can affect what a running page does or shows, verify it at runtime with the next-dev-loop skill before treating the work as done.

Do not run the loop after every small edit (types, renames, comments). Use it for UI, routing, Server Actions, data fetching, and suspected runtime bugs.
